WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.420
[BEEPING]

00:00:02.420 --> 00:00:05.319
[MUSIC PLAYING]

00:00:05.319 --> 00:00:07.610
SPEAKER: Welcome to the first
episode on the Baseline--

00:00:07.610 --> 00:00:09.080
Infrastructure Quest.

00:00:09.080 --> 00:00:10.880
If you're a novice
cloud developer looking

00:00:10.880 --> 00:00:13.760
for some hands-on practice
with GCP's core infrastructure

00:00:13.760 --> 00:00:17.450
services, do yourself a favor
and enroll in this quest.

00:00:17.450 --> 00:00:19.580
As a student, you'll
get practical experience

00:00:19.580 --> 00:00:22.700
by taking labs that dive
into cloud storage, computing

00:00:22.700 --> 00:00:25.460
engines, like Kubernetes,
and key application services,

00:00:25.460 --> 00:00:28.130
like Stackdriver and
Deployment Manager.

00:00:28.130 --> 00:00:31.100
By taking this quest, you'll
develop invaluable skills that

00:00:31.100 --> 00:00:33.680
will apply to any GCP project.

00:00:33.680 --> 00:00:35.810
After you're done with all
the labs in this quest,

00:00:35.810 --> 00:00:38.540
you'll get this badge to
recognize your achievement.

00:00:38.540 --> 00:00:40.790
You can add the badge to
your social media accounts

00:00:40.790 --> 00:00:44.210
and your resume to let others
know about your new skills.

00:00:44.210 --> 00:00:45.980
The way this
playlist works is you

00:00:45.980 --> 00:00:48.020
watch a short video,
like this one,

00:00:48.020 --> 00:00:50.690
where I'll be introducing
you to a lab on Qwiklabs

00:00:50.690 --> 00:00:53.264
and give you a quick overview
of what you'll learn.

00:00:53.264 --> 00:00:55.055
I'll also point you to
additional resources

00:00:55.055 --> 00:00:58.250
where you can find more
information on each topic.

00:00:58.250 --> 00:01:00.030
Once you're done
watching the episode,

00:01:00.030 --> 00:01:02.480
you can head on over to
Qwiklabs and do the lab.

00:01:02.480 --> 00:01:05.690
You can watch all the videos
and then do all the labs,

00:01:05.690 --> 00:01:08.060
or you can work on the labs
and pop over to the videos

00:01:08.060 --> 00:01:10.100
to find the
additional resources.

00:01:10.100 --> 00:01:13.160
This is your quest, and you can
follow it however you'd like.

00:01:13.160 --> 00:01:15.300
You don't even need to
do the labs in order.

00:01:15.300 --> 00:01:16.770
I'm excited to get started.

00:01:16.770 --> 00:01:19.450
So let's move on to our next
episode and our first lab

00:01:19.450 --> 00:01:23.280
in the quest, Cloud
Storage, Quickstart Console.

